          "text": [
            "Welches Gerät war falsch eingerichtet?",
            "Which device was set up wrongly?"
          ],
          "explain": [
            "Der Port Gi1/0/2 auf SW1 war abgeschaltet: show interfaces sagt administratively down, und bei einem gezogenen Kabel stünde dort nur down. Darum half das neue Kabel nichts. no shutdown in der Konfiguration des Ports schaltet ihn ein.",
            "The port Gi1/0/2 on SW1 was shut down: show interfaces says administratively down, and with a pulled cable it would say just down. That is why the new cable did not help. no shutdown in the port's configuration switches it on."
          ]
        }
      ],
